{
    "title": "Concentric - Pixel Watch Face",
    "description": "<i><font color=\"#987FFC\">Developed with <b>Watch Face Format</b></font></i>\r\n\r\nThe Concentric design is originally from the Google Pixel Watch (1). This project recreates it using Watch Face Format making it available to all Wear OS smartwatches supporting the format. The watch face comes with additional styling like the customizable complication. \r\n\r\nThis project is open source:\r\nhttps://github.com/lukakilic/concentric-watch-face\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#1CB173\">CUSTOMIZATION</font></b>\r\n- \ud83c\udfa8  Color Themes (30x)\r\n- \ud83d\udd70  Index Styles (3x)\r\n- \u26ab  AOD Styles (4x)\r\n- \ud83d\udd27  Customizable Complication (1x)\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#1CB173\">FEATURES</font></b>\r\n- \ud83d\udd0b  Battery Efficient\r\n- \ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f  Unique Design\r\n- \u231a  AOD Support\r\n- \ud83d\udcf7  High Resolution\r\n- \u231b  12/24H Format\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#EF930A\">COMPANION APP</font></b>\r\n\r\nThe phone app is there to help you with the installation and setting up the watch face on your smartwatch. Optionally, you can activate notifications to stay informed about updates, campaigns, and new watch faces. \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#EF930A\">CONTACT</font></b>\r\n\r\nPlease send any issue reports or help requests to:\r\n\r\ndesigns.watchface@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>Concentric by Luka - Watch Faces</i>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<i><font color=\"#987FFC\">Developed with <b>Watch Face Format</b></font></i><br><br>The Concentric design is originally from the Google Pixel Watch (1). This project recreates it using Watch Face Format making it available to all Wear OS smartwatches supporting the format. The watch face comes with additional styling like the customizable complication. <br><br>This project is open source:<br>https://github.com/lukakilic/concentric-watch-face<br><br><br><b><font color=\"#1CB173\">CUSTOMIZATION</font></b><br>- \ud83c\udfa8  Color Themes (30x)<br>- \ud83d\udd70  Index Styles (3x)<br>- \u26ab  AOD Styles (4x)<br>- \ud83d\udd27  Customizable Complication (1x)<br><br><b><font color=\"#1CB173\">FEATURES</font></b><br>- \ud83d\udd0b  Battery Efficient<br>- \ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f  Unique Design<br>- \u231a  AOD Support<br>- \ud83d\udcf7  High Resolution<br>- \u231b  12/24H Format<br><br><b><font color=\"#EF930A\">COMPANION APP</font></b><br><br>The phone app is there to help you with the installation and setting up the watch face on your smartwatch. Optionally, you can activate notifications to stay informed about updates, campaigns, and new watch faces. <br><br><b><font color=\"#EF930A\">CONTACT</font></b><br><br>Please send any issue reports or help requests to:<br><br>designs.watchface@gmail.com<br><br><br><i>Concentric by Luka - Watch Faces</i>",
